Model parameters — NOT in this repository
-----------------------------------------
No weights are committed. Every bundle is fetched at runtime from a pinned
revision URL in shared/bundles/manifests/index.js.

  Boltz-2 (boltz-community/boltz-2)
      MIT licence. The affinity export in this fork is derived from
      boltz2_aff.ckpt at revision 6fdef46d763fee7fbb83ca5501ccceff43b85607.

  AlphaFold 3 parameters
      🔴 NOT REDISTRIBUTED HERE, AND NOT REDISTRIBUTABLE BY US. The AF3
      parameters reachable through LocalFold's exports carry Google DeepMind's
      own terms, which are not an open-source licence: they restrict who may
      use them and for what, and they do not permit redistribution. This
      repository ships no AF3 parameter file and no mirror of one. Obtain them
      from DeepMind under their terms if you want to run those models.

  Upstream Boltz-2 checkpoints
      Fetched into refs/ by tools/fetch_boltz_cache.sh, which is gitignored.
      They are needed only to RE-RUN the comparisons in spec/G8-RESULT.md, never
      to run the page.

Third-party code vendored by LocalFold (py2Dmol, ProteinMPNN weights and
others) keeps its own licence; see README-localfold.md and web/vendor/.
